0..74 Comment "/// A stuck call passed to a parameter meets the call its parameter\'s type"
75..86 Comment "/// writes."
87..90 Comment "///"
91..169 Comment "/// `composedHere`\'s type writes `p then q` over its parameters. Each `passed`"
170..250 Comment "/// declaration passes it paths, and states the type with those paths written in"
251..331 Comment "/// place. A variable reads alike in both. A call to `onPath` does not reduce on"
332..404 Comment "/// a variable path, so `composedHere`\'s type must read it as that call."
405..408 Comment "///"
409..482 Comment "/// The checker decides a pure call a type reads to stand as the value it"
483..557 Comment "/// returns. The instantiated type reads the argument in that form, as the"
558..631 Comment "/// stated type writes it. The kernel replays each declaration by its own"
632..644 Comment "/// reading."
645..648 Comment "///"
649..724 Comment "/// - see: #4065 — the checker refused a stuck call passed to a parameter"
725..794 Comment "/// - see: #4038 — a composite by a definition over stuck endpoints"
795..847 Comment "/// - see: #720 — a call argument\'s form in a type"
849..925 Comment "/// The action of `F` on `p`, which does not reduce while `p` is a variable."
